
@startuml

title Diagramme de Déploiement - Syndic Management

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

node "Navigateur Web" {
    [Application React\n(Frontend)] as Frontend
}

node "Serveur Web" {
    [API Laravel\n(Backend)] as Backend
    [Serveur Web\n(Nginx/Apache)] as WebServer
}

node "Base de données" {
    [SQLite/MySQL/PostgreSQL] as DB
}

' Relations
Frontend -- WebServer : Requêtes HTTP/HTTPS
WebServer -- Backend : Proxy inverse
Backend -- DB : Requêtes SQL

note right of Frontend
  Technologies :
  - React 19
  - TanStack Query
  - Zustand
  - Tailwind CSS
  - ShadCN UI
end note

note right of Backend
  Technologies :
  - Laravel 12
  - Sanctum (Auth)
  - Eloquent ORM
  - Cache (Redis/File)
end note

@enduml
